# Paths tracked for developer convenience but kept out of exported source.
#
# `export-ignore` only applies to `git archive` — GitLab's "Download source
# code" buttons and Composer's dist zipballs. The release artifact consumed
# by cms-framework's self-updater is built by the `build_release` job in
# `.gitlab-ci.yml`, which zips the CI working tree directly; anything listed
# here must ALSO be added to that job's `-x` exclusion list or it ships.
solo.yml export-ignore
